{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11113120","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11113120","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1111312001:0":{"text":"여긴 어디죠? 왜 이렇게 소란스러워요...? 제가 기절했다고 안탄드라에게 들었어요.","source_cn":"这是哪里？这么热闹……安丹说我晕过去了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6656BA21599D28CF","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"여긴 어디죠? 왜 이렇게 소란스러워요...? 제가 기절했다고 안탄드라에게 들었어요.","female":"여긴 어디죠? 왜 이렇게 소란스러워요...? 제가 기절했다고 안탄드라에게 들었어요.","variant_male_record_index":"123972","variant_female_record_index":"123973","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1111312001":{"text":"여긴 어디죠? 왜 이렇게 소란스러워요...? 제가 기절했다고 안탄드라에게 들었어요.","source_cn":"这是哪里？这么热闹……安丹说我晕过去了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6656BA21599D28CF","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"여긴 어디죠? 왜 이렇게 소란스러워요...? 제가 기절했다고 안탄드라에게 들었어요.","female":"여긴 어디죠? 왜 이렇게 소란스러워요...? 제가 기절했다고 안탄드라에게 들었어요.","variant_male_record_index":"123972","variant_female_record_index":"123973","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1111312002:0":{"text":"괜찮아요. 신경 써 주셔서 고마워요.","source_cn":"好多了，谢谢你关心我。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7C94D964C39FAC3B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"괜찮아요. 신경 써 주셔서 고마워요.","female":"괜찮아요. 신경 써 주셔서 고마워요.","variant_male_record_index":"123974","variant_female_record_index":"123975","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1111312004:0":{"text":"곧 파티가 시작될 거야! 같이 가자!","source_cn":"宴会要开始了！正好，一起！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF2D9C84291F58ED8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1111312005:1":{"text":"하지만 내 고기는 절대 뺏어 먹으면 안 돼!","source_cn":"但是，你不能和我抢肉吃！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB117691FFA1EFAB9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1111312006:1":{"text":"내가 그런 짓을 왜 해! 그런데... 갑자기 웬 파티?","source_cn":"我才没那么无聊！再说……怎么莫名其妙来了一场宴会啊？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF9412DF6229FDDF1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1111312007:1":{"text":"파티 싫어해? 나랑 안탄드라 언니는 파티 좋아하는데!","source_cn":"你不喜欢宴会？但是安丹姐姐喜欢宴会，我也喜欢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0CC75571E6E1DD39","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1111312008:1":{"text":"언니, 내가 진짜 신나는 노래를 피리로 불어줄게!","source_cn":"安丹姐姐，我给你吹笛子听！我会一首热闹的曲子！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9251D4B3C7BD880E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1111312009:1":{"text":"엄마 아빠가 돌아가시기 전에 가르쳐주신 거야!","source_cn":"这首曲子，是爸爸妈妈去世前教我的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E26ADC650731A22","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1111312010:1":{"text":"돌아가시기 전에...","source_cn":"去世前……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD8AE90665333BAEB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1111312011:1":{"text":"부모님이 돌아가셨구나...","source_cn":"原来你的父母也去世了啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x955BEF7C79D32D7D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1111312012:1":{"text":"응. 하늘나라에서 날 기다리고 있을 거야! 언젠가 다시 만날 수 있을 거라고 믿어.","source_cn":"嗯，他们去那边等我了。我知道，总有一天会和他们再见。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE49C64C949473A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1111312013:0":{"text":"그리고 나한테는 부족원들도 있고 안탄드라 언니도 있으니까! 외롭지 않아!","source_cn":"而且，卡卡还有族人，还有安丹姐姐！所以，不寂寞！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6C79F7AEFFBEFCE8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1111312014:0":{"text":"그래, 그렇게 생각하면 돼.","source_cn":"这么想没错。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF82A6FAEF945809","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1111312015:0":{"text":"응! 그럼 나 이제 피리 분다?","source_cn":"嗯！那么卡卡要吹笛子啦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0391475FE80BE800","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1111312016:0":{"text":"오? 누가 공연을 시작했는데? 자자, 다들 박수!","source_cn":"哦？有人要开始表演才艺啦。来来来！大家都给点掌声！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34D93D236C3B5989","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:2:0:1":{"text":"몸은 좀 괜찮아?","source_cn":"你好点了吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xDE36E89C8C76A17D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"몸은 좀 괜찮아?","female":"몸은 좀 괜찮아?","variant_male_record_index":"63962","variant_female_record_index":"63963","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1111312003:0":{"text":"전 괜찮아요. 하지만 제가 어떻게 쓰러진 거죠?","source_cn":"我没事，我都不记得自己是怎么晕倒的了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x517FDC5A59E306AA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"전 괜찮아요. 하지만 제가 어떻게 쓰러진 거죠?","female":"전 괜찮아요. 하지만 제가 어떻게 쓰러진 거죠?","variant_male_record_index":"123976","variant_female_record_index":"123977","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:2:1:2":{"text":"괜찮으면 다행이야","source_cn":"你没事就好","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x81B5175D24FBBF97","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"괜찮으면 다행이야","female":"괜찮으면 다행이야","variant_male_record_index":"63964","variant_female_record_index":"63965","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:萨忒娜":{"text":"사트라나","source":"萨忒娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:卡卡":{"text":"카이","source":"卡卡","status":"matched_dialogue_